    "summary.md": "# Gym Log\n\nTrack gym workouts and weekly bodyweight so progress stays visible.\n\n- **Target user:** Individuals training at the gym\n- **Build route:** compile\n- **Genome:** tracker\n- **Presentation:** table / directory\n- **Persistence:** browser-local storage\n- **Start:** `npm run dev` → http://localhost:3000\n\n## Planned verification journeys\n\n- Application loads and shows a useful empty state\n- Invalid workout input shows validation without crashing\n- User can add a complete workout and see it in workouts\n- workouts survive a page refresh\n- User can edit an existing workout\n- User can search workouts\n- User can narrow workouts with a meaningful filter\n- workouts are grouped by a meaningful category or status\n- Requested derived values update from persisted records\n- User can delete an existing workout\n"
  },
